2012              cold           8.25
2012              middle       4.46

Here is my code:

p<-ggplot(df, aes(SYEAR, DOC))+geom_boxplot(aes(x=SYEAR, y=DOC, fill=SEASON))
p+xlab("YEAR")+ylab("Dissolved Organic Carbon")

but I don't get the boxplots for each year and each season.

I have also attached a reproducible example in case you want to go through this yourself. I hope that you can help me on this.

Thank you in advance.

Kind regards,
Maria

